r! This is fantastic! Call him back!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      I didn't catch the number. Did you hear it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Here. Let me write it down for you.", "time": "46500"}], "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le08ob10re5aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob10re5img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0}]}